## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Harness working directory
##
## `.harness/output/` is per-run scratch: the Planner, Generator and Evaluator overwrite
## files in here once per iteration. Committing it would bury the history in churn.
##
## `.harness/reviews/` is deliberately NOT ignored — the Monitor archives each sprint's
## artefacts there after every verdict, and that archive is the permanent governance audit
## trail. If you find yourself wanting to ignore it, read `.harness/reviews/README.md`.
## ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.harness/output/*
!.harness/output/README.md
